1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,830
Profiles let you keep different screen layouts and switch between them.

2
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:12,420
Your current profile is shown at the top.

3
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:17,740
Type a name for a new profile and click Create.

4
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:25,930
The new profile opens with the standard layout. Arrange it the way you like — it is saved to this profile.

5
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:31,750
To switch, open Profiles and pick one.

6
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:35,250
Your Default layout comes straight back.

